<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS share index closes at record 377.69.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS share index closes at record 377.69.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System's 22-share RTS index closed on Wednesday at a record 377.69, a gain of 2.31 percent on Tuesday's closing 369.17, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>Total reported market volume was a high $69.42 million.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
